{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":1,"title":"벡터의 합","desc":"<p>숫자 벡터 <code>x</code>의 합을 돌려주는 <code>vector_sum(x)</code>를 만드세요. 빈 벡터의 합은 0이에요.</p>","solution":"vector_sum <- function(x) {\n  sum(x)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>sum()</code> 은 벡터의 모든 원소를 더해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"vector_sum(c(1, 2, 3))","expected":6,"visible":true},{"call":"vector_sum(numeric(0))","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"vector_sum(c(-1, 1))","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"vector_sum(c(2.5, 2.5))","expected":5,"visible":false}],"starter":"vector_sum <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-315"}